for what we were given.

00:10:32.956 --> 00:10:34.733
I think everyone involved on the shoot,

00:10:34.733 --> 00:10:36.567
from the fashion designers to the models

00:10:36.567 --> 00:10:39.992
to all of the interns and
the crew did an amazing job

00:10:39.992 --> 00:10:41.653
and I'm so proud of what we accomplished

00:10:41.653 --> 00:10:43.289
with such little means.

00:10:43.289 --> 00:10:46.573
It's always like comparing
it to having a baby.

00:10:46.573 --> 00:10:49.128
Not nearly as painful, well--

00:10:49.128 --> 00:10:50.649
I don't know what it's like to have a baby

00:10:50.649 --> 00:10:52.134
but it was pretty painful.

00:10:52.134 --> 00:10:54.131
I feel like I just pushed out a human out

00:10:54.131 --> 00:10:55.548
of my phantom vagina.

00:10:55.548 --> 00:10:56.812
So, yeah, it's about to be
unleashed upon the world,

00:10:56.812 --> 00:10:58.287
Wedding Dresses Across Asia

00:10:58.287 --> 00:11:00.442
and I really hope you guys enjoy it.

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:05.120
(upbeat music)

